1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Perhaps you are disillusioned with overconfidence.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Just because you killed my small times aboard.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Sadler, you're small time.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
What are we gonna do Leon?

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
I hate to say it, but we're sandwiched alright.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Hey, what's that dog?

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
I really don't give a damn.

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Rainer Shine, you're going down.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Ah, what a touching moment we have here.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
All spoiled thanks to your interruption.

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,000
No way Leon.

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Way?

13
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Guess that's a local's way of breaking the ice.

14
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Why don't you do us all a favor and leave before the audience gets pissed off?

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Sounds more like an alien invasion if you ask me.

16
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Since you're here, why don't I introduce you to it?

17
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
It should keep you busy.

18
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Can't remember the name, huh?

19
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
A senior moment perhaps.

20
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Is she...

21
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Well, you know...

22
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Don't worry, she's cool.

23
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:11,000
I let our miserable insects out for some exercise down in the sewer.

24
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Thanks, that should keep me company, because boredom kills me.

25
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
All by yourself?

26
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,000
I'm sure you boys didn't just tag along so we could sing kumbayat together at some boys' scout bonfire.

27
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Then again, maybe you did.

28
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Sorry I couldn't get in touch sooner, but I was a bit tied up.

29
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Monsters.

30
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Yes, after this, there'll be one less to worry about.

31
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Gotta go.

32
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,000
If I were you, I'd get off this island too.

33
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
She really pushed it.

34
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,000
But I'm afraid it's Ashley we need.

35
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Not you Mr. Kennedy.

36
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:56,000
If you don't need me, and get off my back, old man!

37
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Oster Luego.

38
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,000
They're called the Lose Illuminados.

39
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Lose Illuminados?

40
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,000
That's a mouthful.

41
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Are you out of your mind?

42
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,000
I knew you'd be fine if you landed on your butt.

43
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Where's everyone going?

44
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Bingo?

45
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Your biggest scene is over.

46
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:26,000
I don't ever remember being a part of your crappy script.

47
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,000
I've been expecting you my brethren's.

48
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,000
No thanks, bro.

49
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:36,000
I've sent my right hand to dispose of you.

50
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Your right hand comes off?

